<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Mostly Questions | Interactive Thought Experiments</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0f172a;
      --card-bg: #1e293b;
      --text: #f8fafc;
      --accent-blue: #38bdf8;
      --accent-green: #4ade80;
      --muted: #94a3b8;
      --border: #334155;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; }
    
    body {
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 680px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    /* Header & Hero */
    header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem 0 1rem;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--accent-blue);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.25;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .subtitle {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    /* Cards */
    .section-title {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--accent-blue);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .game-card {
      background-color: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 1.75rem;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15);
      color: var(--accent-blue);
      padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      width: fit-content;
    }

    .card-title {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .card-desc {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .action-btn {
      background-color: var(--accent-blue);
      color: #0f172a;
      border: none;
      padding: 1rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-align: center;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: block;
      transition: background 0.2s ease;
    }

    .action-btn:hover {
      background-color: #7dd3fc;
    }

    /* Email Box */
    .email-box {
      background-color: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 1.75rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    input[type="email"] {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0.85rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin: 1rem 0 0.5rem;
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      padding: 2rem 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="container">
    
    <!-- Hero Header -->
    <header>
      <div class="logo">Mostly Questions</div>
      <h1>No Easy Answers.<br>Just Real Trade-offs.</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        We turn complex policy debates, podcasts, and documentaries into interactive decision games—replacing political noise with curiosity and systemic awareness.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Featured Game Card -->
    <section>
      <div class="section-title">Featured Experiment</div>
      <div class="game-card">
        <div class="badge">💧 Active Simulation</div>
        <div class="card-title">The Colorado River Water Czar</div>
        <p class="card-desc">
          The 100-year-old river compact has expired. Step into the role of Water Czar across 7 basin states to manage trade-offs between grocery prices, urban lawns, energy grids, and corporate accountability.
        </p>
        <a href="https://water.mostlyquestions.com" class="action-btn">Play the Game ➔</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- About / Framework Section -->
    <section class="game-card" style="background: transparent; border: 1px dashed var(--border);">
      <div class="section-title">The Philosophy</div>
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600;">Why "Mostly Questions"?</h3>
      <p class="card-desc">
        Most public debates force binary choices and outrage. By simulating complex systems, we reveal how every choice has hidden ripple effects—building empathy, highlighting corporate leverage points, and inviting wiser cooperation.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Email Newsletter Form -->
    <section class="email-box">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Join Future Experiments</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.5;">
        Get notified when we release new decision games based on emerging podcasts, policy shifts, and systemic issues.
      </p>
      <form id="homepage-form" action="https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_ENDPOINT_HERE" method="POST">
        <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Enter your email address" required />
        <button type="submit" class="action-btn" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">Subscribe for Updates</button>
      </form>
    </section>

    <footer>
      &copy; Mostly Questions | Curiosity-driven civic experiments.
    </footer>

  </div>

</body>
</html>
